	(text "LOAD SHARING: external TP4056 and battery protection required\nNominal VIN: 5 V. LOAD+ is unregulated: VIN minus D1 drop, or battery voltage.\nJ3 connects to the external protected battery/charger OUT+. Grounds are common.\nD1 is rated 1 A; allowable current depends on thermal conditions."
